// Men of the king's levy.
=== start
[flag verc_north] -> marching
"The king gave me this." He shows you the spear, as if you might not have noticed it. "Before this I had a goat. The goat was my lord's, really. This is mine."
* "Good luck with it." -> END
* "Have you ever fought?" -> fought

=== fought
"Wolves." He considers. "A man, once, over the goat." He looks at the spear. "Romans can't be much worse than wolves."
* "I hope you're right." -> END

=== marching
"Most of us went north with the king. They left the slow ones." He grins anyway. "Garrison, they call it."
* "Goodbye." -> END
